# export prints them (2 decimals, 6 significant digits, so Y carries a 0.1 in quantum). Normal
# [0.1465, 0, -0.9892]: the big underside sloped 8 degrees at the right-hand end of the model.
#
# The triangulation is a lattice with T-junctions -- vertices lying exactly on the long edges of
# neighbouring triangles. Its grid-snapped union (engine.fixes.merge._union, GRID_SIZE 1e-4)
